      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Annie, what happened? Why are you walking so strange?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：我昨天和朋友一起去打羽毛球了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我昨天和朋友一起去打羽毛球了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ zuó tiān hé péng you yì qǐ qù dǎ yǔ máo qiú le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I played badminton with friends yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李力：你们打起来了吗？",
      "traditional": "李力：你們打起來了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì nǐ men dǎ qǐ lái le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Did you get into a fight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：当然不是。我们打了两个小时，没有休息。",
      "traditional": "安妮：當然不是。我們打了兩個小時，沒有休息。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī dāng rán bú shì wǒ men dǎ le liǎng ge xiǎo shí méi yǒu xiū xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Of course not. We played for two hours without taking a break."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李力：即使是这样，你也不应该走路像个僵尸一样啊。",
      "traditional": "李力：即使是這樣，你也不應該走路像個殭屍一樣啊。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì jí shǐ shì zhè yàng nǐ yě bù yīng gāi zǒu lù xiàng ge jiāng shī yí yàng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Even so, you should not be walking like a zombie."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：好吧，好吧。",
      "traditional": "安妮：好吧，好吧。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hǎo ba hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "最主要的原因是我很久没有运动了，所以现在肌肉真的很酸。",
      "traditional": "最主要的原因是我很久沒有運動了，所以現在肌肉真的很酸。",
      "pinyin": "zuì zhǔ yào de yuán yīn shì wǒ hěn jiǔ méi yǒu yùn dòng le suǒ yǐ xiàn zài jī ròu zhēn de hěn suān",
      "english": "Annie: Fine, fine."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The main reason is that I haven’t done exercise for a long time. Therefore my muscles are really sore now."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "李力：哈哈，难怪。你以后还打羽毛球吗？",
      "traditional": "李力：哈哈，難怪。你以後還打羽毛球嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì hā hā nán guài nǐ yǐ hòu hái dǎ yǔ máo qiú ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Haha, no wonder. Will you play again in the future?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "安妮：打，而且会经常打。",
      "traditional": "安妮：打，而且會經常打。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī dǎ ér qiě huì jīng cháng dǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Yes, I will play regularly."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "李力：好的，下次记得叫我。",
      "traditional": "李力：好的，下次記得叫我。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì hǎo de xià cì jì de jiào wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Ok, remember to call me next time."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "安妮：没问题。不过，现在我要去按摩，你要一起去吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：沒問題。不過，現在我要去按摩，你要一起去嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī méi wèn tí bú guò xiàn zài wǒ yào qù àn mó nǐ yào yì qǐ qù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: No problem. However, I’m going to have a massage now, do you want to come with me?"
    },
