    "sentence_translations": [
      "Playing badminton",
      "",
      "Annie: Li Li, wait for me.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Annie, what happened? Why are you walking so strange?",
      "",
      "Annie: I played badminton with friends yesterday.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Did you get into a fight?",
      "",
      "Annie: Of course not. We played for two hours without taking a break.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Even so, you should not be walking like a zombie.",
      "",
      "Annie: Fine, fine.",
      "The main reason is that I haven’t done exercise for a long time. Therefore my muscles are really sore now.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Haha, no wonder. Will you play again in the future?",
      "",
      "Annie: Yes, I will play regularly.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Ok, remember to call me next time.",
      "",
      "Annie: No problem. However, I’m going to have a massage now, do you want to come with me?",
      "",
      "Li Li: Sure. I can come with you.",
      ""
